enerator 节点实现，差异只在于「是否传 video / 是否传 ref_audio / 是否传 prompt」：\n\n| 任务 | 含义 | 必填输入 | 节点接线 | `mask_away_clip` |\n|------|------|----------|----------|------------------|\n| **TV2A** | 视频 + 文本 → 同步音效（Text-Video to Audio） | `video` + `prompt` | LoadVideo + 文本 → Generator | `false` |\n| **TC-V2A** | 文本主导（视频与文本语义冲突时跟文本走） | `video` + `prompt` | LoadVideo + 文本 → Generator | **`true`**（推荐） |\n| **AC-V2A** | 参考音频做音色迁移（Audio-Controlled） | `video` + `ref_audio` | LoadVideo + LoadAudio → Generator | `false` |\n| **V2A** | 纯视频驱动（无文本） | `video` | LoadVideo → Generator | `false` |\n| **T2A** | 纯文本生成音频（无视频） | `prompt` | 直接 → Generator | `false` |\n\n---"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [663.4212646484375, 329.1229248046875], "pos": [264.1063232421875, 1293.21630859375], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [12], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [608.4964599609375, 1125.22509765625], "widgets_values": [8.000000000000002], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "Float", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Float"}, "order": 3}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [267.09589332752637, -233.6614999961244], "scale": 0.8769226950000014}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 240, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "B站，Youtube：T8star-Aix", "bounding": [430.3546447753906, 184.00653076171875, 2836.38525390625, 427.2743835449219]}], "links": [[7, 1, 0, 8, 0, "CONTROLFOLEY_PIPE"], [10, 8, 0, 9, 0, "AUDIO"], [11, 11, 0, 8, 3, "STRING"], [12, 12, 0, 8, 5, "FLOAT"]], "id": "28510a4a-f302-4c9b-be33-978e418b86d4", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 12, "revision": 0}